# CODEOWNERS
#
# GitHub auto-requests the listed owners as reviewers whenever a PR touches a
# matching path. This makes review assignment automatic instead of relying on a
# manual Slack ping (see AGENTS.md).
#
# Rules of thumb:
# - GitHub uses the LAST matching pattern, so the specific lanes below override
#   the catch-all at the top.
# - GitHub never requests the PR author, even if they own the path. That is why
#   most lanes list at least two owners, so an author's own PR still routes to
#   someone.
# - Yuval (@ypesok28) and Jordan (@JordanJunaidi) are the team leads and the
#   backstop reviewers for everything via the default rule.
# - Lane owners are a starting point. Roles shift on this team, so update this
#   file via PR when someone moves lanes.

